OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThermal imaging cameras on loan
OL,4,Afrom libraries
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents across Kent will be able to
OL,7,Fborrow thermal imaging cameras from
OL,8,Flibraries for free, helping them to
OL,9,Fidentify where heat may be escaping
OL,10,Ffrom their homes.
OL,12,FThe cameras can help spot possible gaps
OL,13,Fin insulation to support informed
OL,14,Fdecisions about improving energy
OL,15,Fefficiency.
OL,17,FA total of 23 cameras will be available
OL,18,Fthrough selected libraries across the
OL,19,Fcounty as part of a 12-month trial.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
