OL,3,GNEWSAThermal imaging cameras on loan
OL,4,Afrom libraries
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Palmer, Kent County Council
OL,7,Fcabinet member for communities, said:
OL,8,F"We are giving people free access to a
OL,9,Fpractical tool that can help them make
OL,10,Finformed decisions about improving
OL,11,Fcomfort, reducing energy waste and
OL,12,Fincreasing energy efficiency in their
OL,13,Fhomes."
